                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Decrees of the Congress of the United Mexican States
                        investing President Juarez with extraordinary powers.</hi></head>
                <p>No. 1.—1. Law of 11th December, 1861.</p>
                <p>2. Speech of president of congress.</p>
                <p>3. Explanatory article, secret session.</p>
                <p>4. Law of 7th June, 1861, referred to in above.</p>
                <p>5. Articles of constitution, authorizing extraordinary powers.</p>
                <p>No. 2 —6. Law of May 3, 1862.</p>
                <p>No. 3.—7. Law of October 27, 1862.</p>
                <p>No. 4.—8. Law of May 27, 1863.</p>
            </div>
